\n她身体呈轻微侧向站立，一条腿自然向前迈出，重心落于后腿，形成柔和的 S 型曲线。一只手抬起，指尖轻触颈侧或锁骨位置，另一只手自然垂于身侧，动作克制而富有表现力。头部微微侧转，目光并非正对镜头，而是略微越过镜头前方，神情沉静而从容，带有内敛的自信与文化气质。\n\n妆容依旧保持高级商业质感，以通透底妆与柔和修容强调面部骨相结构，眼妆干净而深邃，唇妆为低饱和暖豆沙色，整体妆效典雅而现代。黑色长发中分，发丝不再完全盘起，而是以低位松束方式固定，几缕发丝自然垂落于耳侧，增加柔软度与女性气息。\n\n灯光采用高端商业棚拍布光方式，主光从侧前方柔和照射，强调面部结构与服装层次，辅以轻微轮廓光勾勒人物边缘与裙摆线条，使人物从背景中清晰分离。整体画面明亮、通透而富有层次，呈现出当代语境下兼具东方审美与国际时尚感的高端杂志封面影像。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 99, "type": "Text Multiline", "title": "提示词", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [77], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [260, 106], "pos": [417.2486267089844, -321.1382751464844], "widgets_values": [896, 1184, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 68, "type": "EmptySD3LatentImage", "title": "图片尺寸和生成数量", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.64", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"batch_size": true, "width": true, "height": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "EmptySD3LatentImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.37.11", "